    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Service : Courier is a competitive game in which the person who becomes a courier and earns more delivery allowances within the limited time wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players must choose the delivery case</strong>\u00a0<strong>they want, pick up the box from the origin of the delivery case, and deliver it to the destination.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A list of deliverables appears on the right side of the screen, and you can select the delivery you want.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If another player chooses a delivery case</strong>\u00a0<strong>first, that delivery\u00a0case</strong>\u00a0<strong>can't be selected.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can choose up to four deliveries at the same time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will get a delivery allowance for every delivery you complete.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery allowances may vary from delivery to delivery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you run out of fuel before you arrive at the gas station, you have to walk to the gas station to get fuel and charge it</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrive at the gas station to recharge your truck before it runs out of fuel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The truck can hold up to four boxes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Play Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15-45 minutes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Key Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD : moving</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E : Get in or out of the truck</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C : Fuel charging</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tab : mini-map</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard 1~5 : Select delivery case</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery Service : Courier is a competitive game in which the person who becomes a courier and earns more delivery allowances within the limited time wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Players must choose the delivery case</strong>\u00a0<strong>they want, pick up the box from the origin of the delivery case, and deliver it to the destination.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A list of deliverables appears on the right side of the screen, and you can select the delivery you want.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If another player chooses a delivery case</strong>\u00a0<strong>first, that delivery\u00a0case</strong>\u00a0<strong>can't be selected.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can choose up to four deliveries at the same time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will get a delivery allowance for every delivery you complete.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delivery allowances may vary from delivery to delivery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you run out of fuel before you arrive at the gas station, you have to walk to the gas station to get fuel and charge it</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arrive at the gas station to recharge your truck before it runs out of fuel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The truck can hold up to four boxes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Play Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15-45 minutes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Key Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD : moving</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E : Get in or out of the truck</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C : Fuel charging</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tab : mini-map</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard 1~5 : Select delivery case</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
